## Open decisions

- **Render deployment**: no deployment exists yet. A real URL will be added
  to `deployment/README.md` only after an actual deployment is created --
  never fabricated ahead of time.
- **v1.0.0 tag**: this repository is feature-complete through Sections
  1-16 and has passed a research-artifact audit (Phase 9; see
  `paper/artifact/`), but has not yet been tagged for a public release --
  see `CHANGELOG.md` and `RELEASE_NOTES.md`.
